nd goods system<br></li><li>In-depth simulation of the villagers<br></li><li>Villagers will react to your actions...<br></li><li>... will you flip through love letters or feel a cold blade at your throat?<br></li><li>Resources and looted treasures improve the village<br></li><li>Forge new equipment and weapons and train your warriors<br></li><li>Enjoy the pleasures of the tavern...<br></li><li>(... and its backrooms)</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519510/extras/26a04a814e39d56a9ee9dc0578c2e948.webp?t=1717709643\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519510/extras/a1f1a73623fc99efe1bed7553473a37a.poster.avif?t=1717709643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519510/extras/a1f1a73623fc99efe1bed7553473a37a.webm?t=1717709643\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519510/extras/a1f1a73623fc99efe1bed7553473a37a.mp4?t=1717709643\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Defend your kingdom.<br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Creatures leave their shadows at night and attack the village<br></li><li>Epic battles with powerful enemies that rage on for several nights<br></li><li>The walls must not break until dawn</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519510/extras/37edf2e5f73204495e1d4a423b0ac268.webp?t=1717709643\" /></span><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2519510/extras/1d6b251193df00d62e3923af662c1b40.poster.avif?t=1717709643\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_as